  "data_policy": "Training, validation, and latent test trajectories are separate. Seeds and Brownian draws are paired across conditions. The baseline trajectories are reused across sweep labels. Pilot repetitions are never mixed with a later scientific run.",
  "comparison_policy": "Compare validation-selected raw full-dictionary LASSO with raw minimum-norm full-dictionary OLS on identical weak systems. Report matched-dictionary coefficient error as the primary metric and latent drift/profile errors as secondary metrics.",
  "output_policy": "Timestamped pilot directory with frozen protocol, source snapshots and hashes, resumable per-repetition jobs, raw records, summary, acceptance report, and figure. This pilot is not a manuscript result."
